# ZYBAR SEO

When modifying or adding any HTML page, follow `SEO_REQUIREMENTS.md` in the project root.

**Every page must have:** unique `<title>`, `<meta name="description">`, `<link rel="canonical">`, viewport. **Exactly one H1** per page; use H2/H3 for sections. **All images:** descriptive `alt` and `loading="lazy"` (except hero). **Product pages:** add JSON-LD Product schema (name, image, description, brand, offers with price/availability). **Admin pages:** include `<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />`. **New public pages:** add to `sitemap.xml` and link from homepage/nav where relevant. Use clean URLs (e.g. `/products/slug/`). Base URL for canonicals and sitemap: `https://zybar.com` (replace with live domain when deploying).
